# Cloudflare Workers Assets `_headers` for the signer origin.
# Template: `vite build` writes dist/_headers with {{PARENT_ORIGIN}} and
# {{API_ORIGIN}} filled from VITE_PARENT_ORIGIN and VITE_API_BASE_URL, the same
# values the signer's code trusts, so the CSP cannot drift from them.
#
# IMPORTANT: Workers merges matching rules. Do NOT put Cache-Control on `/*`
# or it gets concatenated onto `/assets/*` as
#   "no-store, public, max-age=31536000, immutable"
# and browsers treat that as no-store (defeating the CDN/browser cache).

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' {{API_ORIGIN}}; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors {{PARENT_ORIGIN}}
  Permissions-Policy: publickey-credentials-get=(self), clipboard-write=(self)
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin

# HTML entry: never cache so deploys land immediately.
/
  Cache-Control: no-store
/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-store

# Content-hashed Vite assets: cache hard in browser + edge.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# NOTE:
# - connect-src allows only this origin's `/vault` (the partitioned-cookie blob
#   store, served by src/worker.ts) and the app worker's passkey-wallet backup
#   routes (`/api/signer/*`). The signer never talks to Solana RPC; widen this
#   list only with review.
# - clipboard-write=(self): export "Copy to clipboard" uses Clipboard API inside
#   this cross-origin iframe; the parent must also delegate clipboard-write via
#   Permissions-Policy + iframe allow=.
# - frame-ancestors (NOT X-Frame-Options: DENY): the signer is INTENDED to be
#   framed by the app origin. Do not add X-Frame-Options — it would break it.
# - Do NOT enable Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp. It forces the
#   embedder to be crossOriginIsolated and all subresources to be CORP/CORS,
#   which breaks the embedding model for no benefit here. COOP is a no-op on a
#   framed document.
